        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can pull forth both vitality and the void simultaneously to harm your enemies and heal your allies. If your next action is to cast a 1-action or 2-action @UUID[Compendium.avant.spells-srd.Item.Heal] or @UUID[Compendium.avant.spells-srd.Item.Harm] spell, choose one creature in range that would be harmed by the spell, and choose another creature within range that would be healed by the spell. Your <em>heal</em> or <em>harm</em> targets both creatures.</p>"
        },
